#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut16_tested
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio
#! frames  420
#! poster  330
# the studio's tour, as a user: ctrl+o, a double-click on plate, Choose; F5 runs the solver, the Result panel comes
# forward with the field; the 3-D button, Fit (the solver runs in real time: the frames after F5 wait for it)
0   move 600 300
5   key ctrl down
6   key o
7   key ctrl up
20  move 481 280 15
40  down
42  up
44  down
46  up
60  move 864 507 15
78  down
80  up
100 key f5
300 move 1000 640 15
340 move 37 300 15
355 down
357 up
375 move 446 61 15
390 down
392 up
405 move 800 400 10
